<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ti</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY KYKHEITNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Timothy</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">A paaw tuh Grikpaw thua zah a nung tuh Judahnung athuapaw Timote tuh Asia Minor ram kya umpaw Khriccaaw mino nynh thua. Paul nynh Pachia rya a lawnaw kya a bawmtu te a ruiban nynh athua. <char style="bk">Timote kalan Paul Ccaky Kykheitnaw</char> kya uccaw alepaw ccangthum a um.</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Khriccaawbuu lungkhu ccangpyaseinaw kong raeringkunaw a zei. A ccangpyakunaw hae tuh Juda hae tuanaw te Zenta hae tuanaw apykuhpaw zynnaw kyate yn poupaw thua zah, ah laephi pynpi hynh ahoy leipaw nynh thua; ccungccaw hynh humhung zemah ny leipaw byaphi ny khonaw te tungtuh leite, dyku leite abang nynh looh-ae sungnaw te rou nynh khumnaw tuh ah ccou kho oh, a ci hae. (2) A ccaky lungkhu kya khriccaawbuu cciakhaenaw te beiknaw zia konglang ccangpyakunaw, Khriccaaw piccan hae te bawmtu hae nynh pawcihawpaw ziazae mou ccyngku lan cipaw cia a um. (3) Khri ryalahtu hoypaw lang tangnawpaw Timote kya tuanaw pyanawpaw te zyntu hae aphu patae kya a rya konglang a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaawbuu te cciakhaetu hae ccangpyanaw — 1.3—3.16</para>
  <para style="io1">A ryalawnaw konglang Timote ccangpyanaw — 4.1—6.21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aening oun Khumtu Pachia te aening ngaehoinaw athuapaw Khri Jesu kawpyanaw liate Khri Jesu locceihtu athuapaw kae, Paul nynh,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zynnaw kya ka ccaaw ccaccing na thuapaw Timote nang kha ccaw kae ky. Paaw Pachia te ah Bawipaw Khri Jesu kyate thawccinaw, ngaethyaumsahnaw te daenaw tuh na tungvaw la um sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Loc 16.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpyaseinaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mesidonia ram lang ka ccia lyaze kae hopya sya hawte, nang tuh Efesa khua kya na la umhy cih zah ccungccaw abang nynh ahme leipaw ccangpyanaw kha a ccangpya khyh nawlan hae thuasah, <verse number="4" style="v" />phungpaw huataw hae te athangthya leipaw thokeinaw phungpaw hae kha a ngae ry khyh nawlan hae thuasah la hopah hae; tuh-e uccaw hae nynh zynnaw liate ny athuapaw Pachia paccynnaw laeze eikunaw kha a thuakhae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Hynhte bya kae tawsyanawpaw eenaw tuh, athyaapaw thinlung, ahoypaw mawtemaw nykunaw te thyaruhnaw um leipaw zynnaw kyate yn thuapaw sungsakunaw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang nynh tuh-e ccangpyanaw hae tuh cciataw hae zah accakaepaw byahokupaw kalan a paleihkuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh mimaw toulou nynh a ho hae paw te tynkaring lan a kyngku hae paw kong sanmah a thaethya lei hae pite kawbya sazae lang tang a ry hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh kawbya kha hmerarih lan a mang ze, kawbya tuh ahoy cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kawbya tuh adingpaw ccungccaw hanlan raepaw thua khyh, thuasalama kawbya pawlangria lei hae paw te kawngae lei hae paw hanlan, Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw te misei hae hanlan, a thyaa lei hae paw te beiknaw pawlangria lei hae paw hanlan, paaw hae te nung hae a theihtu hae hanlan, ccungccaw theihtu hae hanlan, <verse number="10" style="v" />a ohhuakuh hae paw hanlan, pise te pise, nopi te nopi a sei hae paw hanlan, ccungccaw ruh hae paw hanlan, mihyn hae hanlan, ahme leipaw ccaekia lang tang hae paw hanlan te ahmepaw ccangpyakunaw te arawsekuhpaw miakaw hanlan nynh kawbya tuh rae athua cipaw ah ny oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e ahmepaw ccangpyakunaw tuh thehoy ccoupaw Pachia kya-e aphu-epaw thehoypaw te accawkuh; tuh-e thehoypaw tuh phy lan kae kha yn pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaethyaumsahnaw hanlan Lungtuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thawzung yn pyatu ah Bawipaw Khri Jesu kha ka thehoysah, pawccecize kae hynh a ryalaw lan yn khang zah a lungzipaw lang yn riabua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh langmawlya Pachia saryanaw bya a hopaw, a tuaa a sahtupaw te a puathopaw nynh ka thua. Thuasalama zynnaw hoi leite nythya leite ka la cyipaw athua keiccuze ngaethyaumsahnaw kha ka mue.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Loc 8.3</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9.4-5</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Ah Bawipaw kya-e thawccinaw tuh Khri Jesu kya umpaw zynnaw te sungsakunaw ryte ka hanlan myaryamaw alung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Khri Jesu tuh misei hae khum khylan nynh laephi kalan yn thua cipaw tuh ahmepaw bya thua zah khaleih lawku lan accanpaw nynh thua. Tuh-e misei hae kyaze kae tuh a sei huaccepaw nynh ka thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama zungzae hiinnaw hanlan amaw a zyn vae cih paw ccungccaw hae nynh dosuinkupaw thua khylan, Jesu Khri nynh a sei huaccepaw kae ka tungvaw kya accingpaw ngaesangnaw kha langsaku khylan, kae tuh ngaethyaumsahnaw kha ka mue. <verse number="17" style="v" />Zungzae atynpaw Siapharan, a chih kho leipaw, muih kho um leipaw, amaw kyalya Pachia athuapaw tungvaw kya sawtuanaw te phu-enaw tuh zungzae te zungzae cia um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ccapaw Timote, nang na konglang langmawlya a la ho hae paw profehbya thyhte nang nynh ahoypaw rhaw kha na dou nawlan, hynh-e kawbya hynh kae pya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Zynnaw te ahoypaw mawtemaw nykunaw kha varyng la kyngkuh. Ccungccaw abang nynh tuh-e nykunaw tuh a vua hae keiccuze zynnaw kya arohpaw sanphalung hawte nynh thua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e hae laku kya Himenias te Alexanda a umbua hae, minmin nynh Pachia saryanaw bya a ho khyh nawlan hae, ccangku khylan Satan kalan ka ap vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sawsangpyanaw Kong Thuiheinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngiapyanaw, sawsangpyanaw, alaku te ngiapyanaw te lungtuabya honaw kha ccungccaw balyn hanlan na raepya nawlan oh masaty lan kae ngia oh, <verse number="2" style="v" />aening nynh Pachia nyhpaw hiinnaw kya te sawtua lan umpaw hiinnaw balyn kyakhe daenaw te ah hiin kho nawlan oh te daebabipaw hiinnaw ah hoi kho nawlan oh, siapharan hae te kawhoitu hae balyn hanlan saw la sangpah oh cite kae ngia oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e cyisahnaw tuh aening oun Khumtu Pachia malang ahoypaw te ry lan umpaw nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh khumnaw mue hae sah lah byaccing kha nyh hae sah cite Pachia nynh a ry. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ccangkheit nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia te ccungccaw hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">Hopiatu Ccungccapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Khri Jesu lu kheit rou nynh a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aning nynh ccungccaw balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">shawkhaw nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha a pyaku,</para>
  <para style="m">—tuh-e tuh accyh azawpaw kya ccaekia a khanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e khylan kae tuh phunghotu lang, locceihtu lang, zynnaw te byaccing kha Zenta hae kya ccangpahtu lang khangpaw nynh ka thua. Byaccing nynh ka ho, ka hyn khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2Ti 1.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaawbuu kya Nopi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te pise hae nynh hmin takyh kya thinrianaw te eikunaw um leite athyaapaw kuih kha hangte sawsang hae sah ci ka ry. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhawte nopi hae nynh mah maethyaum leipaw boeining dohoypaw kha lawkute, ozia hoypaw te angaekuh lante ccaankuh hae sah lah, akhekuhpaw sang, sui, palee hae te amee rupaw boeining te ccaankuh nan hae sah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1Pe 3.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Pachia tungvaw rawri sawtuanaw a hoipaw nopi hae nynh cyi lan accan thyhte ahoypaw cyisahnaw khate ccaankuh hae sah ci ka ry. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nopi nynh tuh kawngaenaw abalynte daebabi lan ccangkuh sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nopi nynh ccangpya lan, pise tungvaw kaw hoi lan ka ua khyh, daebabi lan zya um sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Adam tuh masaty rae athua, tukoute nynh Evi kha rae athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Gen 2.7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam kha hynpya thua khyh; nopinung kha hynpya thua zah misei lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Gen 3.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama nopi hae nynh ningccehoyte zynnaw, sungsakunaw te thyaanaw kya atyn hae ze, ccaawsaahnaw kya khum athua cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khriccaawbuu Pastor hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit nynh pastor lang a tang ry ze, ahoypaw ryalaw kha a rypaw nynh thua cipaw tuh akyhpaw bya nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Khriccaawbuu pastor tuh ccaenaw um leipaw athua hahe cih, zu lu kheit kyalya a hoipaw, a sungkuh khopaw, a lungkyhrarihpaw, a ozia hoypaw, mikhia do-oihthyapaw te a ccangpah thyapaw athua cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit 1.6-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />a zu-ae leipaw, a puatho leipaw, a lungnepaw, pekumaeku mang leipaw, phua eih duaa leipaw athua cih, <verse number="4" style="v" />a innbyn kha kou hoy lan a ukpaw, a ccaaw hae kha aphuinphuin te kawngae thyanaw te sawtua thyanaw a hoisah hae paw athua cih; <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize lukhakheit nynh a innbyn kha a ukthya khyh ze, pawtemou Pachia khriccaawbuu tuh a do-oih kho cih? <verse number="6" style="v" />Zyntu thawpaw thua lan khyh, tuhte athua ze, a lysakuh sei cih zah Satan hawte detahnaw lungkhu lang a phungkuh sei cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhpiaze atolang e ccungccaw hae kya thehoy ccoupaw athua cih; tuhkhyhze tuh thethyanaw te Satan kaang lungkhu lang a phungkuh sei cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaaw Piccan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhawte Khriccaaw piccan hae tuh sawtua lan umpaw athua cih hae, a lae pheipaw, misutui eih neihpaw te phua elang a karankuhpaw thua lan khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung athyaapaw khate zynnaw byakhupaw kha varyng a kyngkuhpaw athua cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin tuh masaty syntawtua athua cih hae zah, ccaenaw a um khyh hae ze Khriccaaw piccan rya kha lah hae sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuhawte mih zu hae mah sawtua lan umpaw athua cih hae, ming hae thethya ho hae paw thua lan khyh hae, a sungkuh khopaw, pawpaw balyn kya a lungzipaw athua cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Khriccaaw piccan hae tuh zu lu kheit kyalya a hoipaw athua cih hae, mih ccaaw hae te mih innbyn kha kou hoy lan a ukpaw athua cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Khriccaaw piccan rya kha kou hoy lan a lah hae paw tuh mimaw elang ahoypaw thadynnaw kha mue hae zah Khri Jesu kya umpaw zynnaw kya myarya lepaw rawhoynaw kha a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Myarya Lepaw Byakhupaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aro mawze na kalan thua lan ka ngaehoi, thuasalama na kalan hynh-e ccaw kae zei rynawpaw tuh, <verse number="15" style="v" />taloi kae thua khyh ze, byaccing kya-e atungpi te abingkunaw athuapaw, a hiinpaw Pachia kya-e khriccaawbuu athuapaw Pachia innbyn kya pawtemou um lan accan cipaw na nyku nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ah beiknaw kya-e byakhupaw alenaw zia hynh eiku lanpaw um khyh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia tuh pynsaw lante</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Muisaw liate thyaaccousah athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw hae nynh a muih vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Zenta hae kya ho athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi pynpi kya amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a zyn vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Phu-enaw te vaawlang</para>
  <para style="q1">lawthung athua vae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahme Leipaw ccangpahtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nyalang ccyh kya ccungccaw abang nynh lingthyapaw muisaw hae te raerangsaro hae ccangpyanaw kha oun ngae cih hae zah zynnaw kha oun vua cih hae cite Muisaw nynh ccaerarih lan a ho. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e ccangpyanaw tuh mimaw nykunaw thinlung kha zaezae linpaw sivaw te pingsah athua hae paw mihyn hae kya-e thyaruhnaw kyate nynh a mue hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh zuvaw tangnaw kha a khee hae, byaccing kha nyte a zyn hae paw nynh lungtuabya hote ae lan cite Pachia nynh a raepaw looh hae kha sung lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia nynh a raepaw miakaw tuh marya ahoy; lungtuabya hote lawku lanze pawpaw mah sung lanpaw um khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize pawpaw balyn tuh Pachia bya liate thuasah, sawsangnaw liate thuasah thyaasah athua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri kya-e Ryalahtu Hoypaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />E ccangpyanaw hae hynh nang nynh uteno hae kha na hopya hae ze, nang tuh Khri Jesu ryalahtu hoypaw na thua cih zah, na zui vae paw zynnaw te ahoypaw ccangpyanaw kya-e bya hae khate kua na thua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia te asekuh leipaw phungpaw huataw hae kha vua lah, Pachia te asekuhpaw hiinnaw kya hiin lan la ccangkuh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize pynsaw te asekuhpaw ccangkupaw tuh ccapyh nynh athane, thuasalama Pachia te asekuhpaw hiinnaw tuh pawpaw balyn kya athane, pawccecize tuh-e tuh atu e hiinshe te yn thua cih paw hiinshe hanlan athane cih cite byakinkunaw a um. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ahmepaw bya thua zah khaleih lawku lan accanpaw bya nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e thanenaw hanlan aening tuh thawbang zuakute rya ah lah oh; pawccecize aening tuh ccungccaw balyn hanlan, abyapi lante zyntu hae hanlan Khumtu athuapaw, a hiinpaw Pachia kyakhe ngaehoinaw ah hoi oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />E uccaw hae kong hynh tynkaring lan hopah hae lah la ccangpah hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kum ano keiccuze hum nynh san ae la dothatheih nan sah; thuasalama nang tuh bya kya, ozia kya, sungsakunaw kya, zynnaw kya te thyaapapingnaw kya zyntu hae nynh dosuinkupaw la thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamaw kae thua makhia ccungccaw hae kya Ccathyaa riapyanaw, phunghonaw te ccangpyanaw kha pekite la rae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khriccaawbuu pastor hae nynh na tungvaw mih kuih a khan lya hae ze, profehbya liate phypya na thua zah na muepaw muisaw lasung kha pawlangria leite la um nan. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh na kaethungnaw kha a muih ccaw hae, e uccaw hae hynh palei la tua lah, thawte la zuakuh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Namaw te namaw thuasah, na ccangpyanaw kya thuasah raeringkuh lah, tuh-e ccangpyanaw kya po la tyn; pawccecize tuhcite na cyinaw liate namaw kha thuasah, na hopaw a thaetu hae kha thuasah parouhte na khum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zyntu hae Ryalaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum tang huapaw kha la pe nan, paaw hawte la soihbia. Kum no huapaw pise hae kha neitaw hae hawte, <verse number="2" style="v" />kum tang huapaw nopi hae kha nung hae hawte, kum no huapaw nopi hae kha ccia hae hawte thinlung thyaararih lante la ccuepe hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nomae ccaccing athuapaw nomae hae kha saw la tua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama nomae lukhakheit nynh ccaaw hae tuhkhyhze mintaw hae a hoi lanze, tuh-e ccaaw hae te mintaw hae nynh mih innbyn elang cyi lanpaw mih beiknaw rya kha masaty ccangkuh hae sah lah, mih nung mih paaw hae te mih minnung mih minpaaw hae kha do-oihru hae sah; pawccecize tuh-e tuh Pachia lungrypaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nomae ccaccing thua zah a makhaete a umpaw nopi tuh Pachia kha ngaehoikuh zah sawsangnaw te ngianaw kyakhe nynh khuazi khuadae po atyn. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama pynsaw hoysahnaw kya a hiinpaw nomaenung tuh a hiin pite a chihpaw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin tuh ccaenaw a um khyh ccaw hae, hynh-e kawbya hae hynh la pya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh a puizia hae kha a do-oih khyh lanze, abyapi lante a innbyn hae kha a do-oih khyh lanze, zynnaw a vuapaw thua zah zynleitu laeze houh athah huapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum sung taruh kaw e nomae tuh nomae ccazing kya teebua nan sah, pise lu kheit kyalya zu a la thuapaw, <verse number="10" style="v" />ahoypaw ryalaw hae hanlan thehoy ccousah hae paw; imua hae kha a kua ze, mikhia hae kha a thuasah hae ze, mithyaa hae ccu kha a singpya ze, riathae hae paw kha lunghoysah ze, ahoypaw ryalaw miakaw kha zuakute a law ze, ccazing kya la teebua sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama kum ano huapaw nomae hae kha tuh la nuee hae. Pawccecize ohhuaku rynaw he a hoi hae tuh Khri kha rawsete vawpaw bua a hoi ry hae, <verse number="12" style="v" />masaty e mih zynnaw kha a vua vae hae keiccuze minmin tuh seibenaw a mue hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhlaeze, inn kheit kyate inn kheit kalan pae hae zah thawnawpaw kha a ccangku hae. Mih thawnaw kyalya thua leite thanry hae paw mah thua hae zah ho lan accan leipaw a hopaw, a ccukuh buapaw nynh athua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a rhawtupaw nynh saryanaw lanpaw kha ccyhhoy a pya khyh nawlan, kum a nohua hae paw nomae hae tuh vawpaw la hoi hae sah, ccaaw la sah hae sah, innloo la do-oih hae sah cite ka ry. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize abang tuh cceihsei hae zah Satan nulang a zuikuh vae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Zyntu lukhakheit nynh nomae hae a hoi ze, amaw nynh minmin kha do-oih hae sah lah, khriccaawbuu kha tavuan pya thua nan sah. Tuhteze nynh nomae ccaccing hae kha khriccaawbuu nynh a do-oih kho cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahoyte a uk hae paw pastor hae, abyapi lante phunghonaw kya te ccangpyanaw kya ryalah hae paw tuh sawtuanaw leit ning te ccou lan angaekuh hae cite tua lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa nynh, “Ccatan a tin cciamangpaw tangnuapaw mung kha na bucceih lan khyh,” a ci, te “Ryalahtupaw tuh a ryalaw mee mue lan accan,” bua a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Deu 25.4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccaekia lu ning, tuhkhyhze lu thum a um khyh ze, pastor sei a benaw hae kha nawccawpah nan hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Deu 17.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Mingccang hae nynh mah a ri ccaw hae, a sei hae paw kha ccungccaw balyn malang khe pe hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Lu kheit laeze lu kheit kha maedo huanaw kharouh hoi leite, laesahnaw te pawpaw sanmah na cyi khyh nawlan, Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri malang thuasah, popaw vaaw hae malang thuasah e uccaw hae hynh nang nynh na zui nawlan, bya kae tawsya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Hum ccungccaw tungvaw sanmah na kuih palou la khang nan. Milae seinaw kha mah la neethungkuh bua nan, namaw te namaw kha la thyaasakuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na vue elang te leih na ccinawpaw hanlan, tui kyalya kha la neih nan, thuasalama misutui beihtaraw kha la mangbia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccungccaw abang seinaw tuh raerae alangkuh, mih seinaw hae tuh byapianaw kalan laanmawty vae. Ccungccaw abang seinaw tuh nyalangte nynh alangku. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuhawte ccungccaw abang kya-e ahoypaw ryalaw tuh raerae alangkuh, te alangkuh loh leipaw ahoypaw ryalaw hae mah thuruh kho thua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia a min te a ccangpyanaw kha thethyaccou khyh nawlan, see hae balyn nynh mih bawi hae kha myarya sawtua lan accan cite tua hae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />See hae nynh zyntu athua hae paw mih bawi hae kha uteno nynh kae thua cite pawlangria leite um nan hae sah. Thanenaw a ccou hae paw tuh zyntu hae te sungsah hae paw athua hae keiccu mih bawi hae kha houh ryalawpah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpyaseinaw te Ahmepaw Hoirumnaw</para>
  <para style="p">Hynh-e uccaw hae hynh la ccangpah hae lah la hyy hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh ccanglang te a ccangpya ze thuasah, ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri bya ahmepaw kha a nawccaw khyh ze thuasah, Pachia lante ccianaw te accawkuhpaw ccangpyakunaw kha a nawccaw khyh ze thuasah, <verse number="4" style="v" />aning tuh pawsang ny leite a lysakuhpaw nynh thua. Aning tuh byalungnaw te bya-eikunaw a rypaw nynh thua. Tuh-e hae kyate eiungnaw, pekunaw, thethyahonaw, ahoy leipaw lunghiinnaw, <verse number="5" style="v" />byaccing a hoi leipaw te thinlung kya bya a tuathya lei hae paw ryte thawte eikunaw kha a pousah, Pachia rawrinaw tuh muenawpaw nynh thua cite a tua hae. Khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae kha la sibia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungryachikhaekute Pachia lante cciapaw tuh myarya lepaw muenaw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize aening nynh laephi kalan pawsang mah ah thuakhae khyh oh; pawsang mah ah poukhae kho lan khyh oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aepaw te boeiningsungpue ah hoi oh paw khate ah lungryachikhaeku lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama hoirum a ry hae paw tuh tuhounaw lungkhu lang, kaang lungkhu lang, ngaeenaw patae te ronaw a thuakhaepaw ryduaanaw lungkhu lang nynh a phungkuh cih hae. Tuh-e hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha ronaw te zonaw kya a phungsaku hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize phua eih rynaw tuh hoyleinaw phuin balyn kya-e atharuipi nynh thua. Ccungccaw abang nynh phua eih a ry hae keiccuze zynnaw kyate a cceihsei vae hae, te mimaw te mimaw kha ngaethyanaw pataepi khate a thuingku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zynnaw kya-e Ahoypaw Rhawtuknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou Pachia ccungccapaw, nang tuh tuh-e uccaw hae kha sibia lah dingnaw, Pachia rawrinaw, zynnaw, sungsakunaw, ngaesangnaw te lungnenaw kha hoi lan zuaku tua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Zynnaw khungtaekunaw kya na thawzung balyn kha thuatua, zungzae hiinnaw kha varyng kyngkuh. Tuh-e kalan nang tuh ko na thua zah ccaekia patae malang ahoypaw ccaekia phe na khan vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn hiinnaw a pyatupaw Pachia malang te Pontias Pilat malang ahoypaw ccaekia a khangtupaw Khri Jesu malang, nang kha bya kae tawsyapaw tuh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Joh 18.37</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri yn langkuh cia nang nynh athupaw beku leite, seibe lanpaw a um lei lante, kawbya kha la zui cipaw nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuh-e langkunaw tuh Pachia nynh amaw accyh kya yn langsakuh cih. Aning tuh thehoy ccoupaw, amaw kyalya Uktu athuapaw, siapharan hae Siapharan te bawi hae Bawipaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaw rou nynh chi kho leinaw a hoi, hum nynh san a naeku kho leipaw awnaw kya a umpaw nynh thua; amaw kha hum nynh san muih boi khyh zah muih kho khyh; sawtuanaw te zungzae thungnaw tuh amaw kya um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atu she kya a hoirum hae paw nynh a lysaku khyh nawlan hae, atyn leipaw hoirumnaw kha a doliaku khyh nawlan hae kawpya hae, thuasalama aening ah lungtua nawlan pawpaw balyn phe beih lan oun pyatupaw, a hiinpaw Pachia kha a doliaku nawlan hae kawpya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Minmin nynh ahoypaw ryalaw kya a hoirum nawlan hae, a hysahpaw athua nawlan hae te neethungbua lan a paccynku nawlan hae ahoypaw ryalaw lan kawpya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hiinnaw ccaccing kha a ccou nawlan hae, malang ccyh elang ahoypaw sisua tungpi kha mimaw hanlan a ccakhungkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athangnaw Byataw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Timote, na kya ae apsya hae paw kha la rin. Anungsikuhpaw te accakaepaw byahokupaw te ahme lei lante nynaw a ci hae paw konglang eikunaw kha la sibia. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e ahme leipaw nynaw kha lawkute ccungccaw abang nynh zynnaw kha a poutaw vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Thawccinaw tuh nae tungvaw la um vae sah.</para>
</usx>